    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" caput="6" para="true">CAPUT VI.</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="1" caput="6">De Mutabilitate stellarum secun-</l>
    <l n="3" type="heading" level="1" caput="6">dum substantiam, earundem-</l>
    <l n="4" type="heading" level="1" caput="6">que duratione.</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">I. <i>Equitur ut de generabilitate &amp; cor-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>ruptibilitate stellarum agamus,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7">
      <i>&amp; quandoquidem illa velperpetua, vel tem-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>poraria sunt, de singulis in specie est ali-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>quid dicendum.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10" para="true">II. <i>Stellae perpetuae quemadmodum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>immediate a Deo conditae sunt, ita citra</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>substantialem interitum manebunt usque</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>ad consumptionem mundi: tum vero sub-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>stantialiter easdem corruptum iri non est</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>improbabile.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16" para="true">§. 1: Stellas perpetuas a Deo creatas</l>
    <l n="17">esse Scriptura S. pluribus in locis ex-</l>
    <l n="18">presse docet; &amp; non contrariatur, sed</l>
    <l n="19">potius assentitur recta ratio. Nam quia</l>
    <l n="20">cum mundo durare experientia testa-</l>
    <l n="21">tur, quod secundum est afferti mem-</l>
    <l n="22">brum, cum mundo quoque incepisse</l>
    <l n="23">concluditur: at illud omne creatione</l>
    <l n="24">productum est. Caeterum de eo: <i>An in fi-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25">
      <i>ne seculi stellae sint substantialiter corrum-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26">
      <i>penda, an solum accidentaliter renovan-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="27">
      <i>da?</i> quaeritur. Mihi nihil videtur im-pro-</l>
